EuroOffice plugin for Mattermost
================================

This distribution is a modified version of the ONLYOFFICE app for Mattermost
(https://github.com/ONLYOFFICE/onlyoffice-mattermost),
Copyright (c) Ascensio System SIA, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications made in 2026 by the 88NeX project:

  - rebranded as "EuroOffice", plugin id 88nex.eurooffice;
  - bot renamed from "onlyoffice" to "eurooffice", new icon;
  - configuration JSON tags lowercased for compatibility with the Mattermost
    admin console (which addresses plugin settings in lowercase);
  - upstream marketplace screenshots removed from the bundle.

This is an unofficial integration. "ONLYOFFICE" and "EuroOffice" are trademarks
of their respective owners. This project is not affiliated with, sponsored by,
or endorsed by Ascensio System SIA or the Euro-Office project.

The EuroOffice DocumentServer itself is a separate program (AGPL-3.0) and is
not included in this plugin bundle; the plugin communicates with it over HTTP.
